&lt;h1&gt;Who was Sujan Singh?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The articles on this site are written by Sujan Singh (1930-2007). He was a Botanist who worked for many years for the Forest Research Institute in Dehradun, and then later he ran the Mycorrhiza Network at &lt;a href="https://www.teriin.org/"&gt;TERI&lt;/a&gt;. He had a real passion for learning, with a particular interest in science and philosophy. Learning is something he did every day of his life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div align="center"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;A life dedicated to the pursuit of knowledge is a life worth living&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt; - Sujan Singh&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Contact</title><link>https://www.gurunanakkibani.com/essays/contact/</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.gurunanakkibani.com/essays/contact/</guid><description>&lt;div align="center"&gt;
